{"id":3012,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 骐骥迎春至，万象启新程！1月8日下午信息与通信工程学院在离退休工作部三层活动中心举办了“马跃新程 &nbsp;岁启华章”2026年新春联欢会暨2025年度优秀教师表彰会。学院领导班子全体成员、教职工欢聚一堂，共迎新春，欢庆佳节。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 联欢会上，学院领导班子全体成员向全院教职工送上新春的祝福。院长王黎明代表学院发表了充满激情的新年贺词。他深情回顾了过去一年，学院党委带领全院师生团结协作、拼搏奋斗所取得的显著成绩，向全体教职工表达了诚挚的感谢，致以新年的美好祝福。党委书记孙豫峰希望全院师生齐心协力，抢抓机遇，以饱满的热情和执着的精神投身学院建设，在2026年书写“双一流”高校更加美好的新篇章。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ooz-usUm-sM7W2UUNUZUNV2nmVkLzUnsnNlDolQ7LlQRLmv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkUYhRUSyaLm7iMmTVMzvbUNU4MRNiMmrfMRM2nRrkoR6FU8M2olUao7VFMRNsnRlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DBCCA021569E579BD349565A43FD5B87/CCF9D08A/497D5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ool7u8LR-4L7UDUUzAVU49ZL7VVLRGnPUmU8Mzr7nzf2M490gihFp2hmCIa0MYyPUSy8LkyZMl-PMz7YoRUDM4N8Mm9ZM47bMRviM4rVU4MFnmr7UlnkUlWFM8UZUlLsgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 中北大学副校长尹建平、副校长杨风暴莅临联欢会现场，为师生送来新年祝福的同时新年抽奖。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ooRUuYLmA7Mz-ZMUmvDUmvDLNLDM8-nYnzNbn7lPM462UlC0gihFp2hmCIa0USyinky4U1yiMzfVozTRLRCio7lDnNVfUNQVoR9aoz9aUzQFLN7sLRNsUm6FMRAfUzGJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A5D3B550E99C0658E6FAABFE880980A6/2A7097B7/48AA0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onRvu4nRVRMlUiMU8-DozrVM46fM4GnaUmC4U4r7nRQVnNC0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDLShfMYyYMRN8nmQRoRCsnNMVUl-bLmAfL4nVLl74LlVFozviUlMknNQFo7VfnRVfgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL4Qu2oR62M87aLU7LPLRVfMzlbMlMn7MzV7UlCaM4VfU4U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhVnSh2Lky8UzrVLmC4L4lsoR9Ynz-4n7lbMmCsMzCanNrFMR7YL8UaUmfFMRnVUmvJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CEEF04A5E263357882E23DE9667560FE/4123D0B0/44EB7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oozQuVMmV7o7l4UU4MRL8-bo7UYLRlnsolWfLNU4nmUsnRU0gihFp2hmCIa0oShfU1y8nkyZL7WfU4NPoz94U87ZM8nfMmLDMzMRUlUsnRrFLzlsLR6VLznFM4-PLzU4gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 联欢会以包饺子比赛拉开了序幕，饺子作为中华文化的代表，象征着团圆与幸福，传承着深厚的民俗情感。众多教职工在活动现场饶有兴致地包起饺子，既有传统的月牙饺，也有创意满满的花式饺，展示了他们的独特风格。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=onNQu7UNM7U4L4UUzQ2L4rRU4TVoR6nRLNlPMmWfL8UDoRN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyPUYy4n1yaUzL4nR74nRG8M4nfnRLiLRUiLz7bLzffMRTFnzlDnmrVL7MFM7LbnzlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C1C3F0A33D13D0474AD3504511910A49/E56F5E0C/4C9E5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oMm-uPMmrkollZMU4CZLzLaUNnfMzNnbMR6RLllZnmM7MmL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPUShkMYhRU4NsLRMfL7lbUm94MRvDnlU4MN7ZMmUsnlQFMNV2Uz98ozAFoRMfMzM2gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oMmnu7L498LRnkLURC4olnRL7WfL7VnfnmGbnzUZM4vsM8C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYybUSyaokyDMNn7LR9bMNl4Lz7YU4UiLlnfUmUaU87sUlrFL4fVLmCsU4VFM7LbLl7Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/79A0866DD0896E3112C451DAB40CA7AE/30E267C1/4C91A\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL4LuaUNV7LRUsUUmffnzlPnml4LzGn8ozVVLNUZL7VVUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy4MYh2U1y8Ll-4M4WRLNCsUmv4Lzn7L49bMlVVnm-sMzWFoRffL47iLlWFMmU4U8CsgtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 联欢会上节目形式多样，丰富多彩，有舞蹈、合唱、独唱、小提琴独奏、诗朗诵等9个节目，节目当中穿插游戏和抽奖环节，现场不断爆出阵阵掌声。联欢会在思源艺社学生街舞《彩虹的微笑》拉开帷幕，信息对抗技术专业的歌曲《告白气球》是信通人顾小家的温馨，而电子信息工程的朗诵《我的祖国》是信通人爱大国的赤诚，光电信息科学与工程专业的合唱《superstar》将联欢会的气氛推向了高潮，人工智能专业的《盛世中国》是信通人对当下中国盛世的致敬，生物医学工程专业的合唱《阳光总在风雨后》是信通人不畏险阻、永攀高峰的体现，信息对抗技术专业程伟哲老师带来的小提琴独奏《一步之遥》是信通人对高雅生活的向往，电子信息工程专业侯慧玲老师的《我从草原来》和学院行政老师诗朗诵《时光的刻度》用他们精湛的技艺为大家带来了听觉盛宴，赢得了连连掌声。最后通信工程专业的合唱《相亲相爱一家人》为这场盛会画上了一个完美的句号。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oM8LuDLRrkUzQ2oUz7bUNMfLzNPn7LnsLlCDUln2MR9YUzG0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh2n1yPMkyaL4MVM7UPo7LbLzvDMlr7UzA2nmrRLzWRUmfFLzTRLzGsMRTFMRlDnzlJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CFF14033E4D18C91765EDA8FF5C12CB0/19C10749/456E5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oUznu7LRCPMmCboUzN4U8CbMm74Mm-nPM4Gioz7ZU4M2M770gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPLSyPokysL4UanzLZo7Q2M77DolM2nmnfLz6Vo7UbUmAFnN-sUmrRMmAFMmN4U87agtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL7Uu4U4vYozVRMU462oRMRUlWVnmLnaLRlaL8UZnmvZL4N0gihFp2hmCIa0LShRnSysLYyYMNWfozMfUzNDM8WkLmT7Lz7anNLYnzMRUlVFL4Q7o7n2M4QFMRLiUm9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1CE7326BA93AA967BB29D110FC2E3CAA/36D8DF76/435B8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oLz6ufoRvDnmLbMUNrfnRvDnRv8MN-nPol-4LRUYLRrVLzG0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h7oSyiUYyiLl7DUmNPMRUiU8UbLRnkM4TfLl-YM8LPLNMFM8VfMz6RU8VFMlrVLNlagtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPMm7boSbw62S8c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oL49uZMlL4L8r2UUzf2M8WRM8WRUmNn8Ml7bolLZLlMfoz70gihFp2hmCIa0oSyYnSyDMkyinzliU8W2M8MRMlrRUNnRUmvDU4WVL8QRLRrFLmGbnR-anmQFMz-ZLR9Jqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DLzNbgtA8pUScc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16199&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/92E645E55CBF7CC5ECBDCB76C2E3FC05/209D20F6/52808\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=oLNluPMmnfUNW7MU4GPMm-aLzvPnmCnsU8QkUzTkMzffUmN0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhknShfLSyZM8r7